The 'si' designation is not used on the most recent generation of the BMW X3 (G01/G45). It was used on older generations like the E83 and F25. The current petrol models are designated with 'i' (e.g., 20i, 30i, M40i) or the new 'xDrive30' for the 2025 model year. Since the user requested the most recent version, I will evaluate the most recent BMW X3 30i xDrive, as it is the closest current equivalent to a mid-range petrol 'i' model.

